# GPU-fit tuning: Qwen3.8-27B instruct/non-thinking (Q4) on a single R9700.
#
# Same weights and therefore the same memory budget as
# profiles/r9700/qwen3.8-27b-q4.env (~28 GiB of ~31 GiB at the model's full
# native 262,144 context) -- see that file for the full breakdown and the KV
# math. Only the sampling recipe differs, which costs nothing.
#
# This is the right non-thinking config for a single card. The Q8 instruct
# weights (models/qwen3.8-27b-instruct.env) do not leave room for a KV cache
# here; run those on the pair instead.
: "${CTX_SIZE:=262144}"
: "${UBATCH:=512}"
